5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current system is failing. We need to define the scope of work before assigning it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I feel like the load is uneven. Some of us are here more than others.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about the social friction this causes. We need a sustainable peace.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is paying for the supplies? I keep buying sponges and nobody reimburses me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to know what state the rooms will be in when I walk in.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, how do you propose we measure ""uneven""? We need data, not feelings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, look at the calendar. Some of us are away for weeks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, the money issue is real, but the tension is worse.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, tension is expensive too. I want a clear cost breakdown.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Rin. Predictability is key for me.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,We should look at the actual time spent cleaning. It is likely underestimated.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,And we should check who is actually using the kitchen.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,Let's also see what the previous tenants did. They left a note.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the receipts for the cleaning supplies.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the bathroom grout. It gets dirty fast.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will time a full cleaning pass to get real numbers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will watch the kitchen usage for a fortnight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
