35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The timing data is shocking. A full pass takes over an hour.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The kitchen usage is heavily skewed. Two people cook, the rest just drink coffee.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The previous tenants' note is a warning. They stopped speaking by year two.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The supply costs are high, and the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The grout gets dirty in eleven days. The outside firm requires the room to be tidy first.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, 4,200 yen an hour is expensive. But my time is also valuable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we hire someone, we still have to tidy up for them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, that is the trap. The firm works around mess, they don't fix it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, so we are back to doing the work ourselves, just paying for the labor?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I am worried about the ""tidy beforehand"" rule. It adds a step.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If we do it ourselves, we need a fixed rota. Rotating weekly seems fair.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,A fixed rota ignores that some of us are away for weeks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,A fixed rota is predictable. That helps with the social tension.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,A fixed rota means I know exactly when I am responsible for costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Predictability is good. But what if I am away during my week?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, we can swap weeks. The rota is a baseline, not a prison.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,Swapping is fine. But the kitchen load is still uneven.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,We can adjust the rota if someone is away. The key is the agreement.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am okay with a rota if the costs are clear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think a fixed weekly rota is the most stable option.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
