70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am voting for Option B. It balances the load and is easy to track.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I am still torn, but Option B is better than Option A.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I am voting for Option B. It preserves our peace.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
